# Secrets / credentials — never commit these (repo is public)
# Broad on purpose: the Google-generated key name is
# <project>-firebase-adminsdk-<hash>.json, but any near-miss variant must be
# caught too, so these match anywhere in the name and ignore the extension.
*serviceAccount*
*service-account*
*firebase-adminsdk*
*adminsdk*
*.pem
*.p12
*.key
